;. /evidence_sources_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition evidence_sources
  ;= Validate captured evidence

    This reusable procedure accepts named source evidence and checks its retained
    identity and content. The handbook and source outline invoke this same
    published definition. Publish this procedure before publishing its callers.
    A caller retains the selected definition until the caller is republished.

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= Named source evidence

    ;@ /flow/step checked ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/inventory
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;= Validate source identities and content

    ;@ /flow/result checked
    ;= Validated evidence
